The design of Loq In is inspired by Foqos (https://github.com/awaseem/foqos).
Parts of the blocking logic are derived from Scrollless.

Loq In uses AndroidX, Material Components, Google Play services (location, maps, ML Kit barcode scanning, in-app updates), CameraX, ML Kit, ZXing, Kotlin, and related open-source/library dependencies. Review Gradle dependency metadata for exact versions and license details.

Icons are based on Material Symbols by Google.
